<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-049" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin" source-id="s-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin-ws2261984">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0000" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACBB">沖</persName>出繼從伯侍中<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0007" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACA">景胤</persName>，小名<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0012" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACA">查</persName>，父<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0015" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAC">邵</persName>，小名<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0019" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAC">梨</persName>。宋文帝戲<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0025" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACA">景胤</persName>曰：「<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0030" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACA">查</persName>何如<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0033" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAC">梨</persName>。」<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0036" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACA">景胤</persName>答曰：「<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0042" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAC">梨</persName>是百果之宗，<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-zhangjingyin:p001:m0049" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACA">查</persName>何敢及。」</p>
</text>
